# BF2026 R127 server-side consent boundary. Values below are paths only.
# Do NOT enable these in production. Both files must be owner-private (0600).
BF2026_R127_REVISION_MANIFEST_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/r127-offer-revisions.signed.json
BF2026_R127_REVISION_PUBLIC_KEY_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/r127-owner-ed25519-public.pem
BF2026_R127_CALLBACK_SECRET_FILE=/srv/factory-scratch/bf2026-r118-relay-stage-20261119/private-credentials/r127-getcourse-process-callback.secret
# The manifest must be owner-approved from native GetCourse offer/terms readback and
# Ed25519-signed offline. The public key is pinned by its SHA-256 SPKI fingerprint.
# The callback secret must be copied to a GetCourse Process "Call URL" Authorization header.
# Neither file exists yet. Missing either one keeps all relevant routes HOLD.

# R128 order-scoped GetCourse fields + Process callback readback contract (owner-private 0600).
# This file does not exist until the UI owner creates and verifies both ORDER fields,
# the form population method, and the exact POST Process callback configuration.
